@buyaa-n The "Android is a subset of Linux" scenario is interesting here, as it required the combination of `[SupportedOSPlatform("linux")]` and `[UnsupportedOSPlatform("android")]`, which was previously considered an "inconsistent list." I believe we've iterated such that this combination is now fully supported as is utilized herein; do you agree?

Here's the commit that applies this pattern: https://github.com/dotnet/runtime/commit/aa26acfb2116ecb3eb40b63221a619191c683f31

